Electrical power engineering — sources, networks, machines and continuing service (@electrical-power-engineering: 0, is #chapter, #electrical-power-engineering "foundations/Read-power-engineering-from-zero.lingua#r_11GVTDYSY9YANKJJ9FYF53DK7W") { r_300EPNGATK7PHWNZCQFBXGZFCQ
Begin with a useful electrical service and learn what makes its physical system work: quantities, circuits, fields, machines, conversion, networks, measurement, protection, control and the construction/maintenance evidence behind them.

Start with [Read electrical power engineering from zero](foundations/Read-power-engineering-from-zero.lingua#r_11GVTDYSY9YANKJJ9FYF53DK7W). [Power-engineering sources — complete books, courses, methods and evidence](Sources.lingua#r_12EFX00X7ZXGT9MPMJDYRTNY9N) identifies complete technical books, public courses, design and test methods, primary research and actual access/version conditions. [A full practical and graduate power-engineering programme](study/A-full-practical-and-graduate-power-engineering-programme.lingua#r_762ATXJ9563BT8M3229MP1G1FR) joins the full introductory and graduate reading with substantial practical, mathematical and scholarly investigations.

**Foundations and consistent quantities:** [A load, a source and a continuing service](foundations/A-load-a-source-and-a-continuing-service.lingua#r_2N87DRV5NA20MK2HE1XEC7PF1X), [Electrical vocabulary, ports, nodes and equipment](foundations/Electrical-vocabulary-ports-nodes-and-equipment.lingua#r_4EGYDJC4Z79BQZ6E7WDZX7P0VC), [Voltage, current, power bases and units](foundations/Voltage-current-power-bases-and-units.lingua#r_0HB9Q8TC9SKNWV1EAT1CNG97Z6), [Power, energy, loss, efficiency and useful output](foundations/Power-energy-loss-efficiency-and-useful-output.lingua#r_687M5Y50M8E086E1JGP2V2SGS1), [Matrix, differential-equation and control bridges](mathematics/Linear-algebra-differential-equations-and-control-bridges.lingua#r_5HPRA3VXTJQKHD1RDH620HJW43), [Network theorems, nodal equations and references](networks/Network-theorems-nodal-equations-and-references.lingua#r_7RGN8XXYAZ6CDM7DMZJCNA19V6), [RMS phasors, passive signs and complex power](foundations/RMS-phasors-passive-signs-and-complex-power.lingua#r_556PBA65ZE7BMDDYWHFFR0DK6D), [Active, reactive, apparent and waveform power](networks/Active-reactive-apparent-and-distorted-waveform-power.lingua#r_7ME7DSWC0ZMS4V97BTQGC5C323), [Three-phase sequence, star, delta and total power](networks/Three-phase-sequence-star-delta-and-total-power.lingua#r_7EQNME19CHB8DDTC5RNYVWGBGH), [Symmetrical components, sequence networks and limits](networks/Symmetrical-components-sequence-networks-and-limits.lingua#r_4BYZNGXQMGZC9KWP1RDN3FCP6A) and [Per-unit bases, transformer ratios and base changes](networks/Per-unit-bases-transformer-ratios-and-base-changes.lingua#r_7FMPYRBXVHDAC31RKAKB7292BE) connect the first observations to usable models.

**Networks and apparatus:** [Load models, constant power, impedance and dynamics](networks/Load-models-constant-power-impedance-and-dynamics.lingua#r_490N9DZXVK6YZC3MCTJJ8H6HGZ), [Bus admittance models, topology and taps](networks/Bus-admittance-models-topology-and-taps.lingua#r_08GZBJE51AJ1MMX05MJRY1EXHJ), [Transformers, equivalent circuits and terminal tests](apparatus/Transformers-equivalent-circuits-and-terminal-tests.lingua#r_5CFB3YRV16NZYCS9WN4JSACBFR), [Transformer vector groups, taps and zero sequence](apparatus/Transformer-vector-groups-taps-and-zero-sequence.lingua#r_7WW7P8NTHFDPGZ3D3VVT1GXV48), [Transformer loss, temperature, inrush and condition](apparatus/Transformer-loss-temperature-inrush-and-condition.lingua#r_6AZVVD8G0EGYV5RTBBGN66WQ6R), [Conductors, contacts, temperature and duty](apparatus/Conductors-resistance-contacts-temperature-and-duty.lingua#r_6ZD2CSVVP595WFY53DFRB6T4JR), [Cables, screens, terminations and insulation](apparatus/Cables-screens-terminations-and-insulation.lingua#r_45MNDE4BPX26N004X8583RBAW1), [Transmission lines, distributed parameters and loss](networks/Transmission-lines-distributed-parameters-and-loss.lingua#r_5JFKCZDVB9ZBK40HHJGZQH4A1X), [AC power flow and nonlinear balance](analysis/AC-power-flow-voltage-current-and-nonlinear-balance.lingua#r_1152R24GG899A9DD2S3PY2Q5D2), [An inspectable two-bus AC power flow](computation/An-inspectable-two-bus-AC-power-flow.lingua#r_4NH5W4H1B5YARD5V8V1J3MX7G9), [Distribution networks, phase detail and loss](analysis/Radial-and-meshed-distribution-phase-detail-and-loss.lingua#r_5JDYMJDX74TPPDT59SCKNH0YZ3) and [Harmonics, RMS current, resonance and power quality](analysis/Harmonics-RMS-neutral-current-resonance-and-power-quality.lingua#r_0FX1YMFYJBNA78QNS5ZRKSGPE6) develop physical connections, models, limits and independent checks.

**Measurements, faults and protection:** [Measure power, energy, waveforms and calibration](measurement/Measure-power-energy-waveforms-and-calibration.lingua#r_5P5D0PP8SNAFFR88JE8567KH83), [Current/voltage transformers, saturation and polarity](measurement/Current-voltage-transformers-saturation-and-polarity.lingua#r_3PF6HPV3MFDEE7PBB6Z25QVJ37), [Time reference, synchrophasors and frequency estimation](measurement/Time-reference-synchrophasors-and-frequency-estimation.lingua#r_5V4HEC50TPTSMZCXAV49AK2S78), [State estimation, observability, bad data and topology](measurement/State-estimation-observability-bad-data-and-topology.lingua#r_3HZZS294V9MX6W1EQ7H480C33G), [Fault models, prospective current and time scale](protection/Fault-models-prospective-current-and-time-scale.lingua#r_4FV98NRVV0M3JYR5WG3X2E8KVS), [Fault-current offset, decrement and duty](protection/Fault-current-DC-offset-decrement-and-duty.lingua#r_4SFG3K5ZMNV4JZ95TJXY5543JQ), [Earthing, bonding, return paths and touch/step potentials](protection/Earthing-bonding-fault-return-and-touch-step-potentials.lingua#r_2324AA0XT8K4G0A82TV2ABPK80), [Insulation coordination, surges and dielectric condition](protection/Insulation-coordination-surges-and-dielectric-condition.lingua#r_59ZVMCW67D4VKN4YNEJSPX0Z1Z), [Breakers, fuses, isolation and interruption](protection/Breakers-fuses-isolation-and-interruption.lingua#r_1KEKT04CMTHQ3DYQVX03DEXYDR), [Protection zones, selectivity, sensitivity and reliability](protection/Protection-zones-selectivity-sensitivity-and-reliability.lingua#r_4CE1D8PKEJ964HMZBHQB85PTT6), [Relay tests, functional chains and evidence](protection/Relay-tests-functional-chains-and-evidence.lingua#r_1KPYCNB92Z0PT9E6HS9XM05AJW) and [Settings changes, coordination and cross-party knowledge](protection/Settings-changes-coordination-and-cross-party-knowledge.lingua#r_0TME03Z1QSWTXQDE4TCN62NV84) connect predictions with the actual sensing, interruption and maintained evidence.

**Machines, conversion and controls:** [Magnetic circuits, materials, loss and machine geometry](machines/Magnetic-circuits-materials-loss-and-machine-geometry.lingua#r_26T1DAYPG9F1H903T8GS499Q25), [Windings, poles, slots, harmonics and manufacture](machines/Windings-poles-slots-harmonics-and-manufacture.lingua#r_67S1SDAHWDDYJTXXCDAYGD9MM7), [Synchronous machines, power angle and capability](machines/Synchronous-machines-power-angle-and-capability.lingua#r_1PBXD8QXNWF5SQBMHCN8CYP8T6), [Induction machines, slip, torque and rotor loss](machines/Induction-machines-slip-torque-and-rotor-loss.lingua#r_5MZTZPZAN2H30QEHNC16H3PV0W), [Power devices, switching loss and operating area](conversion/Power-devices-switching-loss-and-operating-area.lingua#r_4KQJVPTWE8CATNA6D9VW39QVC3), [Buck/boost conversion, ripple and operating modes](conversion/Buck-boost-conversion-ripple-and-operating-modes.lingua#r_1SQ4C9GKMGQE9SRW2H8CYCJSBV), [DC links, energy balance, capacitors and protection](conversion/DC-links-energy-balance-capacitors-and-protection.lingua#r_6VS9NHR8PRDF0PG5E1E6GEJQPH), [Drives, torque/speed control and load service](conversion/Drives-torque-speed-control-and-load-service.lingua#r_668AGMR7EG7TY2818PDFR2E0PN), [Excitation, reactive control, limiters and measurement](control/Excitation-reactive-control-limiters-and-measurement.lingua#r_0GBD1BSCV5NBEGWRAX56BQ9WN3), [Frequency, droop, reserves and time scales](control/Frequency-droop-reserves-and-control-time-scales.lingua#r_10E3WX4GPH8P6K6DPVGV1T9K2D), [Small-signal stability, eigenvalues and modal meaning](dynamics/Small-signal-stability-eigenvalues-and-modal-meaning.lingua#r_3FK0KQ9D1RFM86085BWMQF2VJN), [An inspectable fault-clearing swing model](computation/An-inspectable-fault-clearing-swing-model.lingua#r_33KE9HBQFMC4GZJ7817WVHX21C), [Voltage solvability, dynamics and load recovery](dynamics/Voltage-solvability-dynamics-and-load-recovery.lingua#r_7VQ11DKY04F2G6E8XVGQS3PMDZ), [Grid-forming voltage behavior, droop and energy](conversion/Grid-forming-voltage-behavior-droop-and-energy.lingua#r_4VKDJXXE9G6QABBCNQ0GB2KAMH) and [HVDC, AC/DC boundaries and multiterminal systems](conversion/HVDC-AC-DC-boundaries-commutation-and-multiterminal-systems.lingua#r_733GTVZS886FFW1A4MXD3R9Z3T) deepen through complete design, dynamics and material methods.

**Planning and continuing work:** [Economic dispatch, constraints and service cost](optimization/Economic-dispatch-constraints-and-service-cost.lingua#r_667YJCFT9K4GYNNBY0Y8Z30X6W), [An inspectable constrained three-bus dispatch](computation/An-inspectable-constrained-three-bus-dispatch.lingua#r_54G856GK2G38HP34VQS8TMK974), [AC optimal power flow, feasibility and nonconvexity](optimization/AC-optimal-power-flow-feasibility-and-nonconvexity.lingua#r_565HECC4J3Z7PEGQNKAKR2BADB), [Duality, convex relaxations and physical recovery](optimization/Duality-convex-relaxations-and-physical-recovery.lingua#r_7H8HRFCFJM8FJ3YYMSNJ6E2X38), [Unit commitment, reserves, ramping and chronological state](optimization/Unit-commitment-reserve-ramping-and-chronological-state.lingua#r_0QFNTTAR35VZZ8WSRF0ZNBGKBC), [Adequacy, energy limits and correlated failures](planning/Adequacy-energy-limits-and-correlated-failures.lingua#r_1A4E6T6AW67E09WQ2C1NPRH3Y7), [Uncertainty, sensitivity, model error and engineering claims](planning/Uncertainty-sensitivity-model-error-and-engineering-claims.lingua#r_6X4V9ZDF411WG03JF8D8K5SE1Z), [Qualification, acceptance and independent evidence](operation/Qualification-acceptance-and-independent-power-evidence.lingua#r_3F9EEPEZRVVNPKJHJ690DFGW0D), [Design to construction, materials, drawings and tests](operation/Design-to-construction-materials-drawings-and-tests.lingua#r_106H1NB80BZQYBC5FC0TSZ1WMV), [Commissioning, system function and handover](operation/Commissioning-component-tests-system-function-and-handover.lingua#r_27QFYZB06Z0RPZCJT47RG33HK4), [Maintenance, outages, spares and return to service](operation/Maintenance-outages-spares-repair-and-return-to-service.lingua#r_7DVW7TWDKKPHWD780FYGQDCHFB), [Protection, control, SCADA and communication boundaries](operation/Protection-control-SCADA-time-and-communication-boundaries.lingua#r_251RXEWC13723V5N98WDFFHN0Y) and [Electrical service from materials to modern production](systems/Electrical-service-from-materials-to-modern-production.lingua#r_0J3CKGT5DZ697CY2X114MY4WSN) join electrical understanding to an operating system. [A full practical and graduate power-engineering programme](study/A-full-practical-and-graduate-power-engineering-programme.lingua#r_762ATXJ9563BT8M3229MP1G1FR) branches into twenty substantial advanced studies, joining [An integrated electrical-power-system investigation](study/An-integrated-electrical-power-system-investigation.lingua#r_06BN864FF9C0AN3EWZJE78Y6Y3), [Independent power-engineering scholarship and revision](research/Independent-power-engineering-scholarship-and-revision.lingua#r_3KS8BF3MHCY6ZF25STX8AJ4MHN) and [Power-engineering understanding and demanding completion](study/Power-engineering-understanding-and-demanding-completion.lingua#r_1NE4GXBZ7VW8JSRP35AK7YRNJN).

Ordinary `#electrical-power-engineering` assertions connect the selected learning steps. Source and other references support further reading without expanding that selection. Shared [Quantitative and technical literacy](../../../inquiry/quantitative-literacy/Quantitative-literacy.lingua#r_4XVN56PQC13JGNFPV0CSGXDCZ2), [Measurement and metrology](../../../inquiry/metrology/Metrology.lingua#r_3G54ENPA974K19AB5XF0P641N5), [Reproducible computational work](../../../inquiry/reproducible-computation/Reproducible-computation.lingua#r_78FWWJDCV0ZGG7VYSPRCWN56DQ) and [Electromagnetism — charge, fields, matter, waves and physical evidence](../../physics/electromagnetism/Electromagnetism.lingua#r_5TJPESCTTNAKY66JH2QNQYN1PY) Records have specific continuations here. [Engineering — systems, design, construction, and operation](../Engineering.lingua#r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68), [Physics — fields, matter, motion and physical evidence](../../physics/Physics.lingua#r_04A5CP8RTBERZEN4XCCDQ3T47W), [STEM — mathematics, science, and engineering](../../STEM.lingua#r_4B137J3ZBVM7TD2NA797H2CZ7E), [Inquiry — shared ways to understand and investigate](../../../inquiry/Inquiry.lingua#r_75MNKZQKNB0XBG021SWWW2HASB), [Resources and materials — feedstocks, useful properties, production, and recovery](../../../ergon/materials/Materials.lingua#r_14HP6K610XB12E2WGNK9A6VN8D) and [Ergon](../../../ergon/Ergon.lingua#r_00000000000000000000002001) connect the wider physical production and continuing work; questions about assumptions, evidence and purposes return to [Philosophy](../../../philosophy/Philosophy.lingua#r_00000000000000000000001001).

**Continue:** [Read electrical power engineering from zero](foundations/Read-power-engineering-from-zero.lingua#r_11GVTDYSY9YANKJJ9FYF53DK7W).
